<title>HONG KONG: Lam Soon, M.C. Packaging shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Lam Soon, M.C. Packaging shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of food processing group Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd and M.C. Packaging (Hong Kong) Ltd were suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lam Soon held 50.3 percent of M.C. Packaging as of April.</p>
</text>
